Removes the simulator's allowance for a directory a node keeps because a
file a user rule ignores is in it (§7.3, draft 64): I1 compares it
between nodes, I3 takes it for a deletion brought back, and the final
phase waits for its deletion to end, which it never does while the file
is there (quiescence).

test: delocal-sim regressions::a_directory_held_by_an_ignored_file_is_no_divergence
test: delocal-sim sim::tests::directories_held_by_an_ignored_file_are_left_out_of_i1_and_i3

